## 13. Conclusion

HexaMine presents a practical approach toward **low-cost, continuous, and intelligent mine subsidence monitoring**.

By combining **ESP32-based sensor nodes, LoRa communication, IoT connectivity, and AI/ML-based analysis**, the project aims to transform raw field measurements into useful information about changing ground conditions and potential subsidence risks.

The project is not intended to claim that a low-cost prototype can independently predict or prevent mine disasters. Instead, its goal is to establish a **scalable monitoring and early-warning framework** that can be further validated, improved, and integrated with professional mine safety systems.

**HexaMine — Monitor. Analyze. Predict. Warn.**
